sequenceDiagram
 participant User
 participant App as React App
 participant Context as AuthContext
 participant Auth as Supabase Auth
 participant DB as Supabase Postgres
 User->>App: Open application
 App->>Context: Mount provider
 Context->>Auth: Subscribe + getSession
 Auth-->>Context: Session or null
 Context-->>App: user/loading/session state
 User->>App: Save an idea
 App->>DB: Insert owner-scoped row
 DB->>DB: Evaluate RLS
 alt Allowed
 DB-->>App: Insert success
 else Denied
 DB-->>App: Permission error
 end
